      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i was worried bc the pulsing is kinda weird though. it feels like a heartbeat in my belly. u sure it's just the stones? i don't really want to go to the ER if i dont have to, it's so expensive and the wait is always terrible. is there anything else i can take to make the pulsing stop?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
